(ns arbace.repr.llvm.intr
  "LLVM 23's intrinsics as the verifier needs them (doc/cpp/LLVM.md §6.2): the generic intrinsics' names (the part of an
  `llvm.NAME` the target-independent table lists, taken from the pin's libLLVM-23.so, `strings`), the targets whose
  intrinsics are recognised by prefix, and `recognized?`, whether a function's name is an intrinsic of the pin
  (Function::isIntrinsic: its attributes are then the intrinsic's own, the text's ignored)."
  (:require [arbace.string :as str]))

